@StoreApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Browse products and available stock
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get only products currently available in stock
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/available
Accept: application/json

### View one product's stock
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Search products by a partial name
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?name=key
Accept: application/json

### Place an order
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyKey": "customer-1-mouse-001"
}

### Retry the same order safely (returns the original order)
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyKey": "customer-1-mouse-001"
}

### View a customer's orders
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders?customerId=customer-1
Accept: application/json

### Sold-out / insufficient-stock
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-2",
  "productId": 3,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyKey": "customer-2-hub-001"
}
